    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REGISTER YOUR INTEREST\r\n\r\n**Now On Release**\r\n\r\nWelcome to Rockville Manor by Durkan New Homes\r\nDurkan New Homes are pleased to introduce Rockville Manor – a boutique development of 28 homes in Dublin 18. This exclusive collection includes 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments & duplex, as well as 2 and 3 bedroom houses in a variety of sizes.\r\n\r\nSituated in Kilternan with direct access from Glenamuck Road, this exciting development has something for everyone. Thrill-seekers can enjoy year-round skiing and snowboarding at the Ski Club of Ireland, while nature lovers can explore the Dublin Mountains Way, which winds through Kilternan and offers breathtaking hiking trails with stunning views. Nearby, Barnaslingan Wood and The Scalp, a striking glacial valley, provide tranquil walks and picturesque landscapes. For a taste of local life, the Kilternan Country Market is a must-visit, featuring homemade baked goods, organic produce, and handcrafted items every Saturday morning.\r\n\r\nThe development is convenient to a range of amenities including shopping at nearby Carrickmines Park and Leopardstown Shopping Centre, offering a selection of local shops and eateries, including Dunnes Stores. More extensive retail therapy can be found within easy reach at Dundrum Town Centre within a 10 minute drive. \r\n\r\nTransport links are well catered for with the Luas at Ballyogan and Carrickmines Park and Ride nearby. Bus routes 44 and 63 pass by the development and there’s easy access to the M50. \r\n\r\nThere’s also a selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools in the vicinity, including Kilternan National School, Lady of the Wayside, Stepaside Educate Together, Rosemont Girls School, Scoil Thaobh na Coille and Nord Anglia International School to name a few. \r\n\r\nWe are currently registering interest and will be in touch in the coming months with more information.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, if you have any queries please contact a member of our Sales Team: Savills (01-6181398) or Kelly Walsh (01-6645500)"
      },
